  "notes": "Level names 2-7 are proposed in GDD-04 and await owner confirmation; name_status says so per level. Credit rewards are ledger mission_reward amounts (GDD-03 §4.1) and are always paid from an existing account per the GDD-03 design law — a null credits_ncr means the GDD gives no flat credit reward (payment comes from wages, fees or deeds instead). Missions 7.x reference District 2 / City 2, which have no District 1 zone ids — their zone_refs are deliberately empty. Mission ids keep the GDD's own numbering (1.1-8.4) so data, GDD and schema mission_progress rows trace 1:1.",
